    "summary": "I found no substantive defects in this diff. The new section only shows the five requested core metrics (報名率, 到場率, 完看率, 平均觀看時長 and 看完下單率) as「尚不可計算」, with a reason for each, and never shows a value. Each reason matches the WP-20 source inventory: no unique sign-up page visitors as the denominator, no stable link between sessions and registrants, no completion event or approved threshold, no per-viewer key on the ledger, and no completed-view link to orders. The subtitle only says values will appear once data and definitions are ready, so it doesn't claim any calculation is done. Existing analytics reads and calculations are untouched; the change adds only a constant and a markup block. Heading structure is sound: one h2 linked to the section through aria-labelledby, and one h3 per metric card. I couldn't check the page's h1 or the Card component because they aren't in the supplied diff. The test covers the scenarios with and without activity, checks all five labels, expects exactly five unavailable markers, rejects numeric percent or seconds values, and checks two of the reasons. Residual notes that aren't defects: the test finds the section by splitting on the exact rendered attribute string, so it is brittle. The no-activity case calls mockReset on shared mocks, which is only safe if the file's existing setup restores them; that setup isn't in scope here. No tests were run. An empty findings list doesn't mean tests pass or the change is ready to release.",
